#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:5
msgid "Build your own project or task"
msgstr "创建自己的项目或任务"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:7
msgid ""
"The template generator bootstraps the package structure and, when requested,"
" task registration and agent configurations for an Isaac Lab task. Use it to"
" create either a standalone project outside Isaac Lab or a task intended for"
" contribution to the Isaac Lab repository. An external project can start "
"with a working Cartpole example, a stubbed task, or an empty task package. "
"Internal tasks start from the Cartpole example."
msgstr ""
"模板生成器可搭建包结构，并按需生成 Isaac Lab 任务的注册代码和智能体配置。它既可创建 Isaac Lab 之外的独立项目，也可创建准备贡献给 "
"Isaac Lab 仓库的任务。外部项目可从可运行的 Cartpole 示例、待实现的任务框架或空任务包开始；内部任务则从 Cartpole 示例开始。"

