#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:268
msgid ""
"The default ``uv sync`` installs the kit-less Newton backend without Isaac "
"Sim. The generated project's ``[project.optional-dependencies]`` table "
"mirrors every extra declared by the Isaac Lab package used to create it. "
"This keeps backend, visualizer, RL, teleoperation, and other feature extras "
"aligned with that Isaac Lab version. It includes ``rerun``, ``viser``, and "
"``all`` when the active Isaac Lab package provides them."
msgstr ""
"默认 ``uv sync`` 安装不依赖 Kit 的 Newton 后端，不安装 Isaac Sim。生成项目的 "
"``[project.optional-dependencies]`` 表对应创建它时所用 Isaac Lab "
"包声明的所有可选依赖组，使后端、可视化器、强化学习、遥操作等功能依赖与该 Isaac Lab 版本保持一致。当前 Isaac Lab 包提供 "
"``rerun`` 、 ``viser`` 或 ``all`` 时，也会包含这些依赖组。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:275
msgid "Pass each extra required by a command. For example:"
