#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:285
msgid ""
"Place ``--extra`` before ``isaaclab`` and repeat it when a command needs "
"several features. The generated ``all`` extra forwards Isaac Lab's own "
"``all`` extra; the exact contents remain defined by that release. Inspect "
"the generated ``pyproject.toml`` for the complete version-specific list. See"
" :ref:`backends-and-presets` for the backend and preset model and "
":ref:`isaac-lab-quickstart` for supported physics, renderer, and visualizer "
"combinations."
msgstr ""
"将 ``--extra`` 放在 ``isaaclab`` 前；命令需要多种功能时，重复传入。生成的 ``all`` 依赖组转交到 Isaac Lab "
"自身的 ``all`` ，其具体内容仍由对应版本定义。完整的版本专用列表见生成的 ``pyproject.toml`` 。后端与预设模型见 "
":ref:`backends-and-presets` ；受支持的物理、渲染器、可视化器组合见 :ref:`isaac-lab-quickstart` "
"。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:296
msgid "Understand the generated project"
msgstr "理解生成的项目"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:298
msgid ""
"An external project is a single installable Python package with the same "
"standard uv ``src`` layout used by maintained downstream examples. Its root "
"``pyproject.toml`` declares the package, development tools, backend extras, "
"and ``isaaclab.tasks`` entry point."
msgstr ""
"外部项目是一个可安装的 Python 包，采用持续维护的下游示例所用的标准 uv ``src`` 布局。根 ``pyproject.toml`` "
"声明包、开发工具、后端可选依赖和 ``isaaclab.tasks`` 入口。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:303
msgid ""
"The project name identifies the repository and Python package. Task-wide MDP"
" terms live under the separately named task family. Robot-specific scenes, "
"registrations, and agent configurations live under ``config/<robot-name>``. "
"This separation lets a project add another robot configuration without "
"copying the task MDP, or add another task family without creating another "
"repository."
msgstr ""
"项目名标识仓库和 Python 包。任务通用的 MDP 项位于单独命名的任务系列下；机器人专用场景、注册和智能体配置位于 "
"``config/<robot-name>`` 。这样，项目可以添加机器人配置而不复制任务 MDP，也可以添加任务系列而不新建仓库。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:309
msgid ""
"Project-owned USD files and related data live under ``src/<project-"
"name>/assets/data``. The project's ``assets`` module exposes a package-"
"relative ``<PROJECT_NAME>_ASSETS_DIR`` path, so task and asset "
"configurations can locate those files from an editable checkout or an "
"installed wheel. The generated ``.gitattributes`` routes USD files through "
"Git LFS."
msgstr ""
"项目自己的 USD 文件和相关数据位于 ``src/<project-name>/assets/data`` 。项目的 ``assets`` "
"模块提供相对于包的 ``<PROJECT_NAME>_ASSETS_DIR`` 路径，使任务和资产配置无论在可编辑安装还是已安装 wheel "
"中，都能找到这些文件。生成的 ``.gitattributes`` 将 USD 文件交给 Git LFS 管理。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:315
msgid ""
"Code shared by several task families can live in a package such as "
"``tasks/mdp``. The generated task importer skips packages named ``mdp`` "
"while it searches for task registrations, so shared modules do not register "
"as task families."
msgstr ""
"多个任务系列共享的代码可放在 ``tasks/mdp`` 等包中。生成的任务导入器在寻找任务注册时跳过名为 ``mdp`` "
"的包，因此共享模块不会被注册为任务系列。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:320
msgid "A Cartpole project resembles:"
msgstr "Cartpole 项目结构如下："

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:347
msgid ""
"The generated package ``__init__.py`` is intentionally passive. Installing "
"the project exposes ``my_robot_project.tasks`` through the "
"``isaaclab.tasks`` entry point, so importing the package for utilities does "
"not eagerly register tasks. For Blank content, the ``tasks`` directory "
"contains only ``__init__.py`` until you add and import a task package."
msgstr ""
"生成的包 ``__init__.py`` 有意不主动执行注册。安装项目后，通过 ``isaaclab.tasks`` 入口提供 "
"``my_robot_project.tasks`` ，因此仅为使用工具而导入包时，不会立即注册任务。对于 Blank 内容，在添加并导入任务包之前， "
"``tasks`` 目录只包含 ``__init__.py`` 。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:353
msgid ""
"If you opt into the Isaac Sim UI extension, the generator additionally "
"creates ``config/extension.toml`` and "
"``src/my_robot_project/ui_extension_example.py``. Launch Isaac Sim with the "
"generated ``isaacsim`` extra when using it. The default is a headless task "
"package and does not include these files."
msgstr ""
"选择 Isaac Sim UI 扩展时，生成器还会创建 ``config/extension.toml`` 和 "
"``src/my_robot_project/ui_extension_example.py`` 。使用时，选择生成的 ``isaacsim`` "
"可选依赖组启动 Isaac Sim。默认是无界面任务包，不包含这些文件。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:358
msgid ""
"Run commands from the project root so ``uv`` can find the package and task "
"entry point. Commit ``pyproject.toml`` and ``uv.lock`` to give collaborators"
" the same dependency resolution. For a project linked to a source checkout, "
"collaborators must also place that checkout at the recorded relative path or"
" update the source entries."
msgstr ""
"从项目根目录运行命令，使 ``uv`` 能找到包和任务入口。将 ``pyproject.toml`` 与 ``uv.lock`` "
"提交到版本控制，让协作者使用同一依赖解析结果。对于关联源码检出目录的项目，协作者还必须把该目录放在所记录的相对路径，或更新源码条目。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:365
msgid "Develop the generated task"
msgstr "开发生成的任务"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:367
msgid ""
"Start with a dummy agent before training. A zero-action agent is useful for "
"checking resets and passive dynamics, while a random-action agent also "
"exercises the action and observation paths:"
msgstr "训练前，先运行简单智能体。零动作智能体有助于检查重置与被动动力学；随机动作智能体还会运行动作和观测路径："

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:376
msgid ""
"Both commands run until their step limit, their visualizer closes, or you "
"press Ctrl+C. Ctrl+C closes the environment and exits without a traceback."
msgstr "两个命令都会运行到达到步数上限、可视化器关闭或按下 Ctrl+C。Ctrl+C 会关闭环境并退出，不打印异常堆栈。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:379
msgid ""
"Edit the generated environment configuration and task terms under "
"``src/<project-name>/tasks``. The generated package is installed in editable"
" mode, so you do not need to reinstall it after each change."
msgstr "编辑 ``src/<project-name>/tasks`` 下生成的环境配置和任务项。生成的包采用可编辑安装，无需每次修改后重新安装。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:384
msgid "Use the remaining project commands as the task matures:"
msgstr "任务逐步完善后，可使用其余项目命令："

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:394
msgid ""
"The generator includes ``tests/test_registration.py`` to verify the task "
"IDs, environment entry points, and default agent. Its ``pyproject.toml`` "
"installs pytest for development and registers the ``unit``, ``integration``,"
" ``smoke``, and ``kitless`` markers. Add project-owned behavioral tests "
"under ``tests`` and run them with:"
msgstr ""
"生成器提供 ``tests/test_registration.py`` ，验证任务 ID、环境入口和默认智能体。 ``pyproject.toml``"
" 为开发安装 pytest，并注册 ``unit`` 、 ``integration`` 、 ``smoke`` 和 ``kitless`` 标记。在 "
"``tests`` 下添加项目自己的行为测试，再通过以下命令运行："

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:404
msgid ""
"The reusable-looking helpers under ``source/isaaclab_tasks/test`` belong to "
"the Isaac Lab repository test suite and are not installed with "
"``isaaclab_tasks``. External projects should build their environment harness"
" from public APIs and maintain project-local fixtures. Copying "
"``env_test_utils.py`` into a project is vendoring it, so the project must "
"track upstream changes to that copy."
msgstr ""
"``source/isaaclab_tasks/test`` 下看似可复用的辅助工具属于 Isaac Lab 仓库测试套件，不随 "
"``isaaclab_tasks`` 安装。外部项目应使用公共 API 构建环境测试框架，并维护本地测试夹具。将 "
"``env_test_utils.py`` 复制到项目属于内置第三方代码，项目必须跟踪该副本对应的上游变更。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:410
msgid ""
"To configure VS Code or Cursor, run the generated setup task or invoke it "
"directly:"
msgstr "配置 VS Code 或 Cursor 时，运行生成的配置任务，或直接调用："

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:416
msgid ""
"The command selects the active interpreter and creates a git-ignored "
"``pyrightconfig.json``. This child configuration inherits the checked-in "
"Pyright policy from ``pyproject.toml`` and adds the generated project's "
"``src`` import root, installed Isaac Lab packages, and any discovered Isaac "
"Sim extensions. When using the ``isaacsim`` extra, include it while "
