#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:427
msgid ""
"In VS Code, use Pylance and select the interpreter that ran the setup "
"command. In Cursor, install the ``detachhead.basedpyright`` extension "
"instead of Pylance, select the same interpreter, and reload the window. Both"
" language servers read the generated ``pyrightconfig.json``."
