#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:456
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:458
msgid "**The project path is rejected**"
msgstr "**项目路径被拒绝**"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:459
msgid ""
"External projects must live outside the Isaac Lab repository. Enter the "
"parent directory; the generator appends the project name automatically."
msgstr "外部项目必须位于 Isaac Lab 仓库之外。输入父目录即可，生成器会自动追加项目名。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:462
msgid "**The project name is rejected**"
msgstr "**项目名被拒绝**"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:463
msgid ""
"Use a valid Python identifier containing letters, numbers, and underscores, "
"without spaces or hyphens. The name cannot begin with a number."
msgstr "使用由字母、数字和下划线组成的有效 Python 标识，不含空格或连字符，且不能以数字开头。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:466
msgid "**The task family or robot/config name is rejected**"
msgstr "**任务系列或机器人、配置名称被拒绝**"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:467
msgid ""
"Use a valid Python identifier for each name. These names become package "
"directories under ``src/<project-name>/tasks``."
msgstr "每个名称都必须是有效 Python 标识，它们会成为 ``src/<project-name>/tasks`` 下的包目录。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:470
msgid "**The CLI cannot find the generated task**"
msgstr "**命令行找不到生成的任务**"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:471
msgid ""
"Run ``uv sync`` and invoke the command from the generated project root. Then"
" confirm the task appears in ``uv run isaaclab list_envs``. Pass ``--all`` "
"to include tasks from every installed task package instead of limiting the "
"list to the current project's ``isaaclab.tasks`` entry point."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``uv sync`` ，并从生成项目的根目录调用命令。确认任务出现在 ``uv run isaaclab list_envs`` 中。传入 "
"``--all`` 可包含所有已安装任务包中的任务，而不只列出当前项目 ``isaaclab.tasks`` 入口中的任务。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:476
msgid "**Non-interactive arguments are rejected**"
msgstr "**非交互参数被拒绝**"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:477
msgid ""
"Include ``--non_interactive`` after ``--new``. Cartpole is the default "
"initial content; Blank content rejects task, workflow, library, and "
"algorithm options. The error message identifies missing required arguments "
"or incompatible selections."
msgstr ""
"在 ``--new`` 后加入 ``--non_interactive`` 。默认初始内容为 Cartpole；Blank "
"内容不接受任务、工作流、库和算法选项。错误消息会指出缺失的必需参数或不兼容的选择。"

#: source/developer-tools/template_generator.rst:482
msgid "**An optional backend module is missing**"
